      "snippet": {
        "line": 189,
        "text": "pointwiseLabels D A q x = {L | 1 ≤ L.1 ∧ q ∈ tsupport (dyadicMask (L.1 : ℤ)) ∧ slowCoordinates D L.1 x ∈ normalizedBox A L} — the set {γ : (r,z,t) ∈ K_γ} with K_γ the closed dyadic band times the A-enlarged slow box"
      }
